  "prefLabel": "He-P 826.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-P 826.01 Purpose. The purpose of this part is to set forth the licensing requirements for all substance use disorder residential treatment facilities (SUD-RTF) pursuant to RSA 151:2, I(e).\n\nSource. #12658, eff 11-1-18; ss by #14548, eff 3-31-26, EXPIRES: 3-31-36",
